# Installed and built inside the image, never copied from the host
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets: production env reaches the containers through env_file, and the
# client's NEXT_PUBLIC_* through build args. A stray apps/client/.env would
# otherwise be read by `next build` and inlined into the bundle.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
.claude
.agents
.playwright-mcp
planning
docker
*.log
